  "body": "**[Original report](https://bitbucket.org/agriggio/art/issues/90) by silvio grosso (Bitbucket: [silvio grosso](https://bitbucket.org/silvio grosso), ).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nHello everyone,\n\nIt would be useful to add a way to sort files \\(Jpeg, RAWs etc\\) by their date of creation.\n\nAt present you can already filter them by ISO, Aperture etc but not by their date \\(File browser stuff:..\\).\n\nSee also:\n\n[https://github.com/Beep6581/RawTherapee/issues/3317](https://github.com/Beep6581/RawTherapee/issues/3317)\n\n‌\n\nDarktable 3.0 version has introduced a nice way to visualize the date of creation by adding a visual indicator in the GUIs\n\n![](https://bitbucket.org/repo/9pArXyE/images/3284994445-darktable_sort_date.jpg)\n‌\n",
